    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the left side of a freshly painted carousel pig. The skin of the pig is a very light tan. The saddle is light brown, yellow, and black. The tack is green, red, yellow, and pink. The saddle blanket is pink, yellow, and orange. The hoofs are black. The eyes are not painted. The pig is suspended on a pole with a white backdrop. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 8-3-81 LEFT 16A” at the top and “RALEIGH NC WAKE CO RR RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” “RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” has been crossed out.",
